    <item>
      <title>In-Person Stretch Lab at HR Suite-Multipurpose Room at the Howard Service Center</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<div>  <img src="https://localist-images.azureedge.net/photos/53870626921584/huge/0eb06b6fdbea4793bb785960c5b7c8fed1009d05.jpg" style="width: 100%;" />  <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #555;"><strong>Mon, 14 Sep 2026</strong></div>  <div><p>Join us for an in-person Assisted Stretching &amp; Body Alignment Session to increase flexibility, improve your posture, and widen your range of motion. Trained professionals will use super stretching, myofascial release, &amp; trigger point therapy to loosen muscles, ease stiff joints, and support your fluid movement. As well as completing an individualized body stretching session, you can meet with the Howard Health Coach to set a ‘stretch’ goal related to your personal or professional well-being, and enjoy a chair massage. This event is on a first-come, first-served basis.</p>

<p><a href="https://events.howard.edu/event/wellness-wednesday-in-person-stretch-lab">View on site</a> | <a href="mailto:?subject=I found an interesting event%3A In-Person Stretch Lab&amp;body=I found an interesting event you may like%3A%0A%0A%0ADate%3A Sep 14%2C 2026%0A%0ADescription%3A%0AJoin us for an in-person Assisted Stretching %26 Body Alignment Session to increase flexibility%2C improve your posture%2C and widen your range of motion. Trained professionals will use super stretching%2C myofascial release%2C %26 trigger point therapy to loosen muscles%2C ease stiff joints%2C and support your fluid movement. As well as completing an individualized body stretching session%2C you can meet with the Howard Health Coach to set a %E2%80%98stretch%E2%80%99 goal related to your personal or professional well-being%2C and enjoy a chair massage. This event is on a first-come%2C first-served basis.%0A%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fevents.howard.edu%2Fevent%2Fwellness-wednesday-in-person-stretch-lab%0A">Email this event</a></p></div></div>]]></description>
